    "text": "Embeddings turn a piece of text into a list of numbers so that texts with similar meaning sit close together. A search system stores one list for every document, turns the question into a list in the same way, and returns the documents whose lists are nearest to it. The quality of the result depends on the model, on how long each text is, and on whether the question and the documents were prepared in the way the model expects.",
